ath d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button></div><p>Paste the API key exactly as Xweather provides it. This site splits the combined key locally into the client ID and secret required by the Weather API. For GitHub Pages, restrict the key namespace to <b>llm-i-am.github.io</b>. The key stays in this browser.</p><label class="field"><span>Xweather API Key</span><input id="apiKey" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" autocorrect="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="client_id_client_secret" aria-describedby="keyHelp"></label><p id="keyHelp">Use the complete key, including the underscore between its two parts.</p><button class="primary" value="default">Save & Load Weather</button><button id="clear" type="button" class="clear">Clear saved API key</button></form></dialog><div id="toast" class="toast glass" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><script>(()=>{
